{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "五个海关",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 87.82,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "执行模型，是一条链怎么存状态，怎么调用程序，怎么决定谁能改什么。",
   "spoken": "执行模型，是一条链怎么存状态，怎么掉用程序，怎么决定谁能改什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 3.194,
   "speechEnd": 10.067
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "漏洞的本质，在哪条链上都一样。",
   "spoken": "漏洞的本质，在哪条链上都一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 10.52,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 10.615,
   "speechEnd": 13.136
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "程序相信了一个不该相信的输入。",
   "spoken": "程序相信了一个不该相信的输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 13.54,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 13.632,
   "speechEnd": 16.312
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "变的，是输入的样子。",
   "spoken": "变的，是输入的样子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 16.72,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 16.819,
   "speechEnd": 18.49
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "在 EVM 上，合约拥有自己的存储，攻击者换不掉它。输入是参数和外部调用。",
   "spoken": "在 EVM 上，合约拥有自己的存储，攻击者换不掉它。输入是参数和外部掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 18.94,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 19.034,
   "speechEnd": 27.004
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "在 Solana 上，程序本身不存状态。账户全部由调用者传进来。",
   "spoken": "在 Solana 上，程序本身不存状态。账户全部由掉用者传进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 27.4,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 27.4,
   "speechEnd": 33.099
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "在 Move 上，状态是带类型的对象。输入是对象，风险常在数学库和权限。",
   "spoken": "在 Move 上，状态是带类型的对象。输入是对象，风险常在数学库和权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 33.54,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 33.54,
   "speechEnd": 39.655
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "在 Bitcoin 上，链只记录交易。铭文这类资产的余额，由链下的索引器解释。",
   "spoken": "在 Bitcoin 上，链只记录交易。铭文这类资产的余额，由链下的索引器解释。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 40.08,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 40.173,
   "speechEnd": 46.623
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "在 Cosmos 上，各条应用链用 IBC，验证对方链上的状态。",
   "spoken": "在 Cosmos 上，各条应用链用 IBC，验证对方链上的状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 47.02,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 47.119,
   "speechEnd": 51.965
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 52.36,
   "dur": 0.8,
   "speechStart": 52.46,
   "speechEnd": 52.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "五个国家的海关，都要防走私。",
   "spoken": "五个国家的海关，都要防走私。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 53.38,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 53.38,
   "speechEnd": 55.68
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "EVM 查行李，Solana 查护照，Move 给每件货物贴防伪芯片。",
   "spoken": "EVM 查型李，Solana 查护照，Move 给每件货物贴防伪芯片。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 56.08,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 56.171,
   "speechEnd": 61.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "Bitcoin 只查集装箱的封条，不管里面装什么。Cosmos 和邻国互认海关章。",
   "spoken": "Bitcoin 只查集装箱的封条，不管里面装什么。Cosmos 和邻国互认海关章。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 62.3,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 62.403,
   "speechEnd": 68.361
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "走私者在每个国家，都找最薄弱的那一环。",
   "spoken": "走私者在每个国家，都找最博弱的那一环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 68.76,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 68.76,
   "speechEnd": 72.615
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的跨生态集成里，同一笔资产会经过好几个国家。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的跨生态集成里，同一笔资产会经过好几个国家。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 73.06,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 73.156,
   "speechEnd": 79.57
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "每多一种模型，就多一组需要专门知识的检查项。",
   "spoken": "每多一种模型，就多一组需要专门知识的检查项。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 80.0,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 80.101,
   "speechEnd": 83.972
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "先看护照这一关，Solana。",
   "spoken": "先看护照这一关，Solana。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
